{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-01_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-01","title":"免費擁抱","storyCode":"4-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"194fa863fab80e3be8a982ee10b0c8afbbed26f6bbd43870bbeb517c47f3d102","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十一（后）\n6:03 p.m. \\ 多雲 \\ 能見度 19公里\n龍門外荒漠 \\ 14號設施"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......已經到達目標地點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有發現其它異常情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"報告完畢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"霜葉......你一路上，怎麼總是皺著眉頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是有點在意阿米婭她們的狀況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭她們已經順利回到羅德島了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"臨光和杜賓一個星期前就已經動身前往龍門外的其他地區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"同時出動她們兩個，應該也是挺艱難的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鋼和企鵝物流也有自己的事情要處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，雷蛇姐和芙蘭卡姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"她們，她們平安就好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"你可也要好好加油才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蘭卡把你交到我手上的時候，可是跟我說她很看好你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"真......真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"她說，前提是你別那麼怕生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......別突然就一副要哭出來的樣子呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是黑鋼的一員嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我沒有......沒有在哭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......不管怎麼說，先繼續任務吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"我們接下來的任務，就是和各個偵察小隊一同，偵察這座廢城的各個區域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"除了搜救倖存者之外，還需要勘察一下狀況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"如果出現了感染者問題，必須速戰速決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不是什麼特別危險的任務，但也得小心謹慎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"萬一和整合運動有關的話，就將必要資訊通知凱爾希醫生並撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來......該是我們認真工作的時候了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"6:12 p.m. \\ 多雲 \\ 能見度 19公里\n羅德島\n廢棄移動城市區塊-\"14號設施\"被發現後 第2天"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......博士，你來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"來得剛好，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這邊的工作也做的差不多了，得暫時離開一段時間~"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"要走了嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......知道了。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我會想你們的。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"很快就能再見面的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"只要過一小段時間，我們就能回到羅德島重新待命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"不要太想我哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"唉唉，可惜可惜，我們這邊沒有那樣的正經理由呢，德克薩斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"你給我等等......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"企鵝物流，馬上要回去休假囉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然只有寶貴的一天，但是！但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉。不是適合在這種場合說的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不會......休息也是必要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......這句話，應該是我說給你聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯沒錯。阿米婭，你啊，也該好好休息一下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島還有必須要處理的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"我能理解，但是阿米婭，你可不能給自己太多壓力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"即使信念強大，一直勞累下去，身體也會承受不住的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"你可不能病倒了，大家都指望著你呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......一直受到大家的關照。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"但你戰鬥的身姿也鼓勵了大家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"不論如何，這就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"趁這個機會，我要去羅德島做個免費的身體檢查，然後再回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的任務也差不多結束了。接下來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，{@nickname}博士。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"——？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我在聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡&能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蘭卡&能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"加油~&Cheer up !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"彙報結束之後，我們會立即返回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，之後的生活，還要繼續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，保重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"大家......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。請多保重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"下次再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我得再去龍門外圍的貧民區看看。應該能幫上忙。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一個人去不要緊嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"會不會很危險......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"阿米婭，我陪你吧？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"隸屬羅德島的幹員，紅，正在龍門執行其他任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"她很厲害的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"有她在，你可以放心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克薩斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙蘭卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["雷蛇"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["霜葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["隕星"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["潔西卡"]}]}
